__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
.env
data/raw/*.json
data/processed/*.json
data/exports/*.json
data/exports/*.md


# Pricing observations are a working ledger with human attestations in them.
# A transcribed figure records a named person having read a page, so it must be
# created by that person and never committed from a demo run.
data/market_pricing.json
data/exports/market_competitors.json

# In-progress census output. The tool rewrites this after every record, so
# committing mid-run risks a torn write, and a partial census in the repo is the
# "partial state presenting as complete" failure this study keeps finding. Added
# explicitly with `git add -f` once the run finishes and a summary block exists.
analysis/adjudication_coverage_census.json
